==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is almost as easy as [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea/Nagasaki]]. Just spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|cats]] and send out periodic [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cats]], as Snache is not much stronger than Doge.

