==Trivia==
*In [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Saga Prefecture'''. In the Taiwanese version, stage 2 is set in '''Hong Kong''' and Mongolia appears later as [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|stage 5]].
*Mongolia's base is a [[wikipedia:Yurt|yurt]] (also called a ger), a kind of portable tent used by nomads in Mongolia, Siberia and Turkey.
*The elderly woman on Saga Prefecture's base is a reference to ''Saga no Gabai Baachan'' (Gabai Granny from Saga), a series of novels written by Shimada Yōshichi based on his childhood growing up with his grandmother in Saga. The woman's stance and attire suggest that it is specifically the [https://www.hulu.jp/saga-no-gabai-bachan movie adaptation] being referenced.
*Prior to [[Version 11.7 Update|version 11.7]], there were 4 extra [[Snache]]s which spawned after bringing the enemy base down to 50% HP, with a delay of 1-2 seconds between each Snache.

